<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rōsĕa</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rōsĭa</span></b> , ae,
			f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a very fertile district near Reate</i>, now <i>Le
				Roscie</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 7, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 1, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 2, 9</span></i> and 10; <i><span class="en">Plin. 17, 4,
				3, § 32</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				4, 15, 5</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rōsĕus</span></b> 
				(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rōsĭus</span></b> ), a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Rosea</i>, <i>Rosean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 712</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cannabis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 9, 56, § 174</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rōsĕānus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>Rosean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">equi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 7, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
